flowchart LR
  accTitle: NutsNews daily database backup freshness
  accDescr {
    The daily database job writes and verifies an encrypted off-machine backup. Grafana and
    production readiness use one 30-hour freshness window. A missing, failed, or older result
    blocks recovery confidence and sends the operator to the backup and restore runbooks.
  }
  Timer["Daily database backup timer"] --> Export["Create compressed database dump"]
  Export --> Verify["Validate checksum and upload\nto encrypted remote"]
  Verify --> Live["Live unmanaged exporter\nlast-run is not safe freshness"]
  Verify --> Staged["Infra-staged hardened exporter\npreserves last success; not deployed"]
  Staged --> Evidence["After protected deploy: export success\ntimestamp and unavailable state"]
  Live --> Unavailable["Grafana age stays explicitly unavailable\nuntil fresh metric exists"]
  Evidence --> Fresh{"Age below 30 hours?"}
  Fresh -->|"Yes"| Ready["Backup evidence is fresh"]
  Fresh -->|"No"| Stale["Grafana stale alert and\nrecovery blocker"]
